[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0180","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0180.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3037","title":"Apple iOS WebKit UAF漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 5.1.1 及更早版本的 WebKit 引擎存在使用后释放漏洞，源于在处理 TIFF、PNG、JPEG 图像及 ImageIO 框架时存在多处内存错误。攻击者可构造恶意图片或网页诱导用户访问，触发内存损坏实现任意代码执行。同时影响 Google Chrome 17.0.963.65 之前版本，源于匿名块分割时对未指定变量的不当类型转换，远程攻击者可通过精心构造的文档触发拒绝服务或潜在代码执行。攻击条件为用户访问恶意网页或查看恶意图片，无需认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 6.8（中高危），影响 iOS 设备及旧版 Chrome 浏览器用户。Apple 在 iOS 6.0 中修复，Google 在 Chrome 17.0.963.65 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3037"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-05T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:28Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apple iOS 至 6.0 或更高版本（通过设置 > 通用 > 软件更新或 iTunes 更新），升级 Google Chrome 至 17.0.963.65 或更高版本（通过菜单 > 帮助 > 关于 Google Chrome 自动更新），升级 Safari 至 6.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级 iOS，可暂时禁用 Safari 浏览器并使用第三方浏览器（如 Chrome for iOS）作为临时缓解措施，同时避免访问不可信网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=113439","http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=114924","http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=115028","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00012.html","http://osvdb.org/79796","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48419","http://secunia.com/advisories/48527","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-19.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52271","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026759","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73648","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/de