c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3036","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3036.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3036.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3036","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0aa53285166fed6b300b29cf483b59e9c54d85d6/2011/CVE-2011-3036.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0179.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0178","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0178.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3035","title":"Google Chrome SVG use元素释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome（WebKit 引擎）在处理 SVG use 元素时存在释放后重用漏洞（CWE-416）。当程序释放内存后未正确清除指针，攻击者可构造特制的 SVG 文档，通过诱导用户访问恶意页面触发对已释放内存的访问，导致浏览器崩溃（拒绝服务），在特定内存布局下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 17.0.963.65 之前版本，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级高危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3035"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-05T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:28Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 17.0.963.65 或更高版本，Chrome 浏览器会自动检查更新，也可通过\"关于 Google Chrome\"菜单手动触发更新。使用 Apple Safari 的用户应升级至 Safari 6.0 或更高版本，Apple iOS 用户应升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本。基于 WebKit 的第三方应用也需更新到包含该修复的版本。openSUSE 用户可参考 openSUSE-SU-2012:0374 安装对应更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=112212","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announ