"cve_id":"CVE-2011-3034","title":"Google Chrome SVG文档释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 17.0.963.65 之前版本中存在一处释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，该漏洞位于 WebKit 引擎处理 SVG 文档的过程中。当用户通过 Chrome 浏览器访问包含特制 SVG 内容的恶意网页时，远程攻击者可利用该漏洞触发已释放内存的非法访问，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能实现任意代码执行。攻击条件为用户只需使用受影响版本的 Chrome 浏览恶意构造的网页即可触发，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。Google 已在 2012 年 3 月发布的 Chrome 17.0.963.65 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3034"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-05T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:28Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 17.0.963.65 或更高版本（可通过 chrome://settings/help 检查更新并自动升级）。使用 Chromium 的发行版（如 openSUSE、Gentoo）请更新系统软件包至包含该修复的版本。该漏洞亦影响 Apple Safari/iOS 中使用 WebKit 的组件，Safari 应升级至 6.0 及以上版本，iOS 升级至 6.0 及以上版本。确保启用 Chrome 自动更新功能，避免禁用浏览器自动升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=111748","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00012.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48419","http://secunia.com/advisories/48527","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-19.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52271","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026759","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73645","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14839","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0