37","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00012.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48419","http://secunia.com/advisories/48527","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-19.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52271","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026759","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73643","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14438","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c61100b82badca16ad107892eaf1ce53a00c3776/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3032.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3032","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3032","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7ebe16a87d7482b578f5baf29517e74408f62ab5/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3032.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3032","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3032","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3032.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3032.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3032","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e360b144e9e9de9c01917f4eb9026f28ed6b0719/2011/CVE-2011-3032.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0176.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2011/EXP-AVE-2011-0176.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0176.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0175","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3031","title":"Google Chrome V8 元素包装器 Use-after-free 漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器内置的 V8 JavaScript 引擎在元素包装器（element wrapper）处理过程中存在释放后使用（use-after-free）漏洞。当浏览器处理特定 DOM 元素时，内存对象可能被提前释放，但程序仍试图访问已释放的内存区域。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 17.0.963.65 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。攻击条件为诱使用户访问包含恶意代码的网页，通过特制的网页内容触发 V8 引擎中的内存错误，可能导致浏览器崩溃（拒绝服务）或在某些条件下执行任意代码，进而危害用户系统安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3031"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-05T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:27Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 17.0.963.65 或更高版本，以修复 V8 引擎中的 use-after-free 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时使用其他浏览器访问不可信网站，并避免点击可疑链接或打开未知网页。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=105867","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00012.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48419","http://secunia.com/advisories/48527","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-19.xml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52271","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026759","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73642","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14967","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/761c156ad3eda85b7d2b67fee400e658dfbee229/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3031.json","https