”界面触发自动更新，或前往官方网站下载最新安装包以消除该内存错误引用漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=112847","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/02/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48016","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14955","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3027.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3027","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/53f6046d6bc3edd16e076ae391d494ba7302fe9f/osv/cve/2011/UBUNTU-CVE-2011-3027.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/041916a4bbe5f9cbf864643dca3b8c710245f3cd/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3027.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3027","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/53f6046d6bc3edd16e076ae391d494ba7302fe9f/vex/cve/2011/CVE-2011-3027.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3027","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3027","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3027.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/98f78a3416723dbfe56c27c011c6c9fcb654559d/2011/CVE-2011-3027.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0174.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0173","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0173.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3026","title":"libpng 图像处理库远程整数溢出漏洞","description":"libpng 库的 `png_decompress_chunk()` 函数中存在一个整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。当程序处理精心构造的恶意 PNG 图像文件时，由于对数据长度的截断处理不当，会导致整数溢出，从而触发内存损坏。该漏洞广泛影响使用了受影响 libpng 版本的软件，包括 Google Chrome（17.0.963.56 之前版本）以及 iOS 6.0 之前的设备。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户加载特制的图像文件，在无需身份验证的情况下触发该漏洞，导致应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务）或实现远程代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3026"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-16T20:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:27Z","remediation":"建议将 libpng 库升级至 1.4.11 或更高版本。对于 Google Chrome 用户，请升级至 17.0.963.56 及以上版本；对于 Apple iOS 用户，请升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本以消除该整数溢出漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=112822","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/02/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00004.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-02/msg00020.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-02/msg00023.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48016","http://secunia.com/advisories/48110","http://secunia.com/advisories/49660","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201206-15.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5501","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15032","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2011/CVE-2011-3026.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2011/CVE-2011-3026.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2011/CVE-2011-3026.md","https://github.com/argp/cve-2011-3026-firefox/blob/c5e6864bf530be1bd253ef1d451616069bf6582a/cve-2011-3026.html","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3026","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3026","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-3026.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3026","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3026","https://github.com/GarageGames/Torque3D/blob/c669fd4005890d68557103940883da555b295e97/Engine/lib/lpng/CHANGES","https://github.com/argp/cve-2011-3026-firefox"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0173.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2011/EXP-AVE-2011-0173.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0173.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0172","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0172.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3021","title":"Google Chrome WebKit 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器中的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在释放后使用（use-after-free）漏洞。该漏洞位于子框架（subframe）加载处理逻辑中，当浏览器在加载嵌套子页面时，若内存中的对象已被释放而程序仍尝试继续访问该对象，即可触发此漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含恶意内容的特制网页，诱导用户访问该网页，当浏览器解析并加载其中的子框架页面时触发漏洞，导致浏览器崩溃（拒绝服务），在某些情况下可进一步执行任意代码，完全控制用户系统。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 17.0.963.56 之前的所有版本，CVSS v3 基础评分 7.5，危害等级高。Google 已在 17.0.963.56 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户尽快升级浏览器至最新版本以消除安全风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3021"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-16T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:26Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 浏览器升级至 17.0.963.56 或更高版本。用户可通过点击浏览器菜单中的“关于 Google Chrome”触发自动更新检查并安装最新安全补丁，以修复 subframe 加载相关的内存管理漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-0