blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0172.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0171","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0171.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3016","title":"Google Chrome 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器存在释放后使用（use-after-free）漏洞，其底层 WebKit 渲染引擎在处理文档计数器节点（counter nodes）时存在内存管理缺陷，已被释放的内存区域仍可被后续操作读取引用，导致释放后使用。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含恶意特制内容的网页，诱导用户使用受影响版本的 Chrome 浏览器访问该页面，从而触发内存错误，实现任意代码执行或导致浏览器崩溃，CVSS 评分 6.8。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 17.0.963.56 之前的所有版本，用户无需任何额外操作，仅需正常浏览恶意网页即可遭受攻击。Google 已于 2012 年 2 月发布 Chrome 17.0.963.56 安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3016"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-16T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:26Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 17.0.963.56 或更高版本，该版本已修复 counter nodes 相关的 use-after-free 漏洞。如使用 iOS 设备，同时将 Safari 升级至 6.0 或将 iOS 升级至 6.0。临时缓解措施：在 Chrome 地址栏输入 chrome://flags 并禁用相关实验性功能，或在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript 以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=106336","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/02/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48016","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14919","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3016.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3016","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3eeaeb834be138ec333241b53d2f3ecf4145ea0/osv/cve/2011/UBUNTU-CVE-2011-3016.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHea